    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DRS102 · Assessment 5/6</span>\n<h2>Lab9, Lab10       (practice 5)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13343 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DRS102 · Đầu điểm 5/6</span>\n<h2>Lab9, Lab10       (practice 5)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13343 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">N/A</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 5 — Lab 1 Students practice drawing the form of Cube and Sphere on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 6 — Lab 1 Students practice drawing the form of Cube and Sphere on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 7 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 8 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 9 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 10 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 11 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 12 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 17 — Lab 3 Students practice drawing a set of still life with basic objects arranged by the teacher on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 18 — Lab 3 Students practice drawing a set of still life with basic objects arranged by the teacher on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 19 — Lab 4 Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 20 — Lab 4 Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 21 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 22 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 23 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Session 24 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 5 — Lab 1 Students practice drawing the form of Cube and Sphere on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 6 — Lab 1 Students practice drawing the form of Cube and Sphere on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 7 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 8 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 9 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 10 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 11 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 12 — Lab 2 Students practice drawing a set of 4 basic blocks: Cube, sphere, prism, cone,…on the fabric background on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 17 — Lab 3 Students practice drawing a set of still life with basic objects arranged by the teacher on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 18 — Lab 3 Students practice drawing a set of still life with basic objects arranged by the teacher on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 19 — Lab 4 Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 20 — Lab 4 Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 21 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 22 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 23 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li><li>Buổi 24 — Lab 4 (cont) Students practice drawing still life with objects that have difficult shapes on A3 paper.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
